auth {
  mode: bearer
}

auth:bearer {
  token: {{api_key}}
}

docs {
  # PublicApi
  
  Headless Externa Public CMS API under `/api/v1`.
  
  ## Auth (folder default)
  
  Bearer token `{{api_key}}` (Admin → API Keys). Requests with `auth: inherit` use this.
  
  **List Collections Anonymous** overrides with `auth: none` to hit the system role `public`.
  
  ## Permissions
  
  Grants live on the role (Collection access matrix), not on Spatie admin permissions:
  
  - Anonymous → role `public`
  - API key → role linked to the key
  
  Actions: `create` | `read` | `update` | `delete`. Missing grant = **deny** (403).
  
  ## Env vars
  
  | Variable | Purpose |
  |----------|---------|
  | base_url | App origin, e.g. `http://externa-core.test` |
  | api_key | Secret `ek_…` |
  | collection_slug | Target collection |
  | item_id | Target item for get/update/delete |
  
  Docs site: externa-docs → Public CMS API.
}
